WEBVTT

00:12.750 --> 00:15.259
My name is Naofumi Iwatani.

00:15.260 --> 00:17.659
I was just an ordinary college student,

00:17.660 --> 00:21.699
but one day I was summoned to another world
and became one of the Four Cardinal Heroes,

00:21.700 --> 00:23.920
the Shield Hero.

00:24.260 --> 00:29.380
The Four Cardinal Heroes had been scattered,
but we finally started to work together.

00:30.060 --> 00:31.890
And yet, even at a time like this...

00:32.340 --> 00:39.890
Raphtalia's parents' homeland, Q'ten Lo,
sent assassins to my territory to kill her.

00:40.220 --> 00:47.320
All because she resembles their Heavenly Emperor
when she wears the kimono outfit.

00:55.140 --> 00:58.249
To settle things with that ridiculous country,

00:58.250 --> 01:03.420
I'm heading to Siltvelt,
said to be where the ship departs.

01:05.460 --> 01:09.109
The resurrection of one of
the Four Guardian Beasts, Phoenix, draws near.

01:09.110 --> 01:10.220
But before that,

01:10.680 --> 01:15.640
I have to resolve this situation
that would determine Raphtalia's fate.

01:20.130 --> 01:21.629
You're right.

01:21.630 --> 01:23.770
Let's take a break around here.

01:39.330 --> 01:42.190
Thanks, Gaelion.
I'm fine...

01:44.770 --> 01:46.729
The border's just up ahead.

01:46.730 --> 01:50.340
We need to head back to our territory
and reorganize our personnel.

01:52.110 --> 01:53.050
Gaelion?

01:53.380 --> 01:54.260
What is it?!

01:55.070 --> 01:57.600
Drifa Aqua Blast!

02:06.560 --> 02:08.670
Master!

02:09.320 --> 02:10.279
Eh?

02:10.280 --> 02:11.940
Filo? Raph-chan?

02:12.640 --> 02:15.070
Hey, what was that for all of a sudden?!

02:15.450 --> 02:17.499
That's my line, Melty!

02:17.500 --> 02:20.039
What are you guys doing out here?

02:20.040 --> 02:22.659
You're the one who told us
to go train in the first place.

02:22.660 --> 02:26.169
Still, it seems way too convenient
to be a coincidence that we met here.

02:26.170 --> 02:27.869
Well...

02:27.870 --> 02:32.300
So, um, on the way during our training,
we ran into Fitoria.

02:32.820 --> 02:33.799
Fitoria?

02:33.800 --> 02:37.639
She said we would find you
if we came this way.

02:37.640 --> 02:41.060
She has a favor to ask of you
and wanted us to pass it on.

02:41.410 --> 02:42.719
That can wait for later.

02:42.720 --> 02:46.500
I have a more urgent and annoying
business to deal with right now.

02:48.380 --> 02:50.569
B-But, Naofumi...

02:50.570 --> 02:54.819
Fitoria already did a bunch of stuff
as advance payment for your help.

02:54.820 --> 02:57.909
Not my problem.
And I haven't gotten anything from her.

02:57.910 --> 02:59.439
What do you think?

02:59.440 --> 03:04.330
In exchange for lowering my and Filo's levels,
she raised our overall attributes.

03:05.300 --> 03:06.949
More than double?!

03:06.950 --> 03:10.490
That's about the same level I was at
when I challenged the Spirit Tortoise...

03:11.350 --> 03:12.880
I still refuse.

03:16.390 --> 03:20.599
Wait, Naofumi!
She also took care of my class-up!

03:20.600 --> 03:23.019
If it's a request, you can
at least hear her, right?

03:23.020 --> 03:24.999
I can't do it!

03:25.000 --> 03:29.650
Um, Fitoria said it has to be Filo and Master.

03:31.270 --> 03:33.030
Is she communicating with you now?

03:33.350 --> 03:34.010
Yep!

03:35.550 --> 03:38.359
I see. So, you're heading to Q'ten Lo.

03:38.360 --> 03:41.489
Umm, Master says,

03:41.490 --> 03:46.870
"Are you going to kill the Four Cardinal Heroes
because I won't grant your request?”

03:48.270 --> 03:50.400
Fine. I'll put up with it.

03:50.870 --> 03:53.210
But I don't care if you end up
regretting this later.

03:53.770 --> 03:55.830
He said, "Go ahead."

04:10.560 --> 04:12.150
Siltvelt...

04:25.410 --> 04:29.080
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

05:48.740 --> 05:53.370
EPISODE 1: SILTVELT

05:58.160 --> 06:03.220
This is Hengen Muso Style First Stance: Sun!

06:09.410 --> 06:12.239
How can Atla do that...?

06:12.240 --> 06:14.379
You're amazing, Atla!

06:14.380 --> 06:18.769
According to Eclair, she's got real talent
for the Hengen Muso Style.

06:18.770 --> 06:20.649
I've got to work harder too...

06:20.650 --> 06:24.200
The Shield Hero and the others are back!

06:24.630 --> 06:26.370
Welcome back!

06:28.710 --> 06:31.620
We'll reach the Siltvelt border by tomorrow.

06:32.110 --> 06:34.329
From there, I'm thinking
we'll travel overland.

06:34.330 --> 06:36.580
So can I pull the carriage?

06:36.890 --> 06:40.929
Sure. But we can't take
the carriage through the portal.

06:40.930 --> 06:45.720
Melty, could you ask the Queen to arrange
for a carriage near the border checkpoint?

06:46.070 --> 06:48.420
Easy for you to say...

06:48.990 --> 06:51.000
I'll see what I can do.

06:52.260 --> 06:53.890
Understood.

06:54.950 --> 06:57.599
Filo is confirmed, so the rest...

06:57.600 --> 06:59.739
It's a demi-human nation.

06:59.740 --> 07:03.819
It would be troublesome to bring Melty,
a member of Melromarc's royal family.

07:03.820 --> 07:05.859
I know that!

07:05.860 --> 07:08.570
I'll handle things in the territory
while you're gone, okay?

07:08.890 --> 07:10.189
Thanks.

07:10.190 --> 07:11.700
What about Fohl and Atla?

07:13.220 --> 07:15.330
They haven't missed a day of training.

07:15.980 --> 07:18.000
Their strength has been improving rapidly.

07:35.580 --> 07:39.440
I wonder what would happen
if you don't bring them along.

07:39.950 --> 07:43.740
Siltvelt is also their homeland, after all.

07:44.210 --> 07:47.219
So they might be useful.

07:47.220 --> 07:49.660
Naofumi, what about us?

07:50.150 --> 07:55.379
I’d love to have you come, but neither of you
is fully healed from the curse yet.

07:55.380 --> 08:00.849
They've been going to the hot springs on
Cal Mira Island many times for therapy.

08:00.850 --> 08:04.630
It's been helping,
but it'll still take some time.

08:04.950 --> 08:09.339
I see. Be sure you're back on your feet
before the Phoenix resurrection.

08:09.340 --> 08:10.760
Got it.

08:11.500 --> 08:14.600
I'll help them recover as quickly as possible.

08:15.790 --> 08:22.410
For now, the team will be me,
Raphtalia, Filo, Sadeena, Fohl, and Atla.

08:24.040 --> 08:26.070
Of course you're coming too, Raph-chan.

08:27.650 --> 08:31.919
So, were there any attacks by
Q'ten Lo's assassins while I was away?

08:31.920 --> 08:33.909
About that...

08:33.910 --> 08:36.619
There haven't been any
since the first attack.

08:36.620 --> 08:37.579
What?

08:37.580 --> 08:39.119
Even though...

08:39.120 --> 08:43.069
The enemies from your world
should also be targeting this place,

08:43.070 --> 08:45.050
but they haven't shown up at all.

08:45.480 --> 08:47.459
What's going on?

08:47.460 --> 08:50.049
Were their scouts wiped out,
and now they're on high alert?

08:50.050 --> 08:52.010
I hope so.

08:52.500 --> 08:56.710
I'd at least like to deal with any attackers.

08:57.150 --> 08:59.100
But they're not showing up at all.

08:59.510 --> 09:02.169
We'll have to see
how they move from here.

09:02.170 --> 09:06.380
Still, I wonder where Motoyasu is now.

09:06.820 --> 09:09.820
It would be reassuring
if he were here.

09:12.850 --> 09:16.950
Targeting my father-in-law's territory
is an outrageous act!

09:17.630 --> 09:21.790
There were also some ninja-like guys
aside from you lot...

09:22.260 --> 09:26.499
But for the sake of Father-in-law
and my beloved Filo!

09:26.500 --> 09:29.729
I'll wipe you out, body and soul!

09:29.730 --> 09:32.839
Wait! I don't want to be taken down like this!

09:32.840 --> 09:34.550
Judgment!

09:37.550 --> 09:42.100
Now then, let's go deliver divine punishment
to the next scoundrel!

09:50.070 --> 09:52.489
How's the carriage, Filo?

09:52.490 --> 09:55.329
The wood they used feels different.

09:55.330 --> 09:57.710
Does the wood make that much of a difference?

09:58.620 --> 10:00.289
But they're both about the same.

10:00.290 --> 10:01.970
What kind of answer is that?

10:02.750 --> 10:06.210
- More and more people are gathering.
- Mr. Shield Hero!

10:06.660 --> 10:12.380
Maybe word got out that we were coming
when the Queen arranged the carriage for us.

10:12.960 --> 10:14.430
Don't let your guard down.

10:14.790 --> 10:15.429
Yes.

10:15.430 --> 10:17.199
Oh, come on.

10:17.200 --> 10:20.430
Since we're all here,
why not have a drinking party?

10:27.820 --> 10:32.029
I humbly report to you, Heavenly Emperor.

10:32.030 --> 10:34.179
The false Heavenly Emperor's party

10:34.180 --> 10:38.490
has just crossed the checkpoint
and entered Siltvelt.

10:40.450 --> 10:42.949
However, please rest assured.

10:42.950 --> 10:47.659
The Shield Hero, along with
the heinous criminal...

10:47.660 --> 10:51.549
...who dares covet Your Eminence's
rightful throne, will be eliminated...

10:51.550 --> 10:54.650
...before they ever set foot in Q'ten Lo.

10:55.760 --> 11:01.469
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

11:01.470 --> 11:04.669
How about it, Fohl?
Does it bring back memories?

11:04.670 --> 11:08.449
I don't know.
I've never seen this area before.

11:08.450 --> 11:10.900
I don't really remember much either.

11:12.250 --> 11:16.489
Still, it's strange that we were able to
pass through the checkpoint so easily.

11:16.490 --> 11:18.510
What's going on?

11:19.850 --> 11:23.329
What does that banner say?

11:23.330 --> 11:27.329
Even if you can't read it, you can guess
what it says from everyone's expressions.

11:27.330 --> 11:31.710
It says, "A Warm Welcome to the Shield Hero."

11:32.860 --> 11:35.469
I see. So you can read it, Fohl.

11:35.470 --> 11:39.119
That's about the only thing
my brother is actually useful for.

11:39.120 --> 11:40.410
Hey! That's so mean!

11:49.970 --> 11:51.599
Keep going just like that, Filo.

11:51.600 --> 11:52.900
Okay!

11:54.250 --> 11:57.019
From here on, the Shield Hero's party

11:57.020 --> 12:02.120
will be escorted and led to the royal castle
by the Siltvelt Royal Guard!

12:06.310 --> 12:08.869
As expected of Siltvelt.

12:08.870 --> 12:11.649
They're revering and praising Master Naofumi.

12:11.650 --> 12:13.749
Such a wonderful country.

12:13.750 --> 12:15.130
Atla...

12:16.490 --> 12:19.200
It's just like a feudal lord's procession.

12:20.380 --> 12:23.289
Even I'm surprised.

12:23.290 --> 12:26.230
Naofumi really is a hero, huh?

12:26.620 --> 12:30.479
This reminds me of something
the Queen of Melromarc once told me.

12:30.480 --> 12:31.699
That's...

12:31.700 --> 12:33.190
What was it?

12:33.690 --> 12:34.400
"First..."

12:35.070 --> 12:39.659
First, Mr. Iwatani will be surrounded
by princesses, noble ladies...

12:39.660 --> 12:43.620
...and women of many races,
all seeking your affection...

12:43.970 --> 12:46.579
...and forming a harem.

12:46.580 --> 12:48.040
A harem?

12:48.340 --> 12:52.030
And then, stricken by an unknown illness,

12:52.510 --> 12:55.049
Mr. Iwatani will tragically...

12:55.050 --> 12:57.779
T-That could never happen!

12:57.780 --> 13:02.779
Siltvelt worships the Shield Hero
as a god, as king!

13:02.780 --> 13:04.179
This country would never...

13:04.180 --> 13:06.140
I hope you're right.

13:09.930 --> 13:14.980
In any case, we need to get out
of this country as quickly as possible.

13:31.050 --> 13:32.900
Shield Hero.

13:33.320 --> 13:37.720
Welcome, welcome back to Siltvelt.

13:38.130 --> 13:40.050
I am overwhelmed with emotion at your return.

13:41.790 --> 13:47.179
I am Werner, representative
of the Shusaku race.

13:47.180 --> 13:49.140
It is an honor to make your acquaintance.

13:49.490 --> 13:50.869
Shusaku race...?

13:50.870 --> 13:53.280
I'm Naofumi Iwatani, the Shield Hero.

13:53.780 --> 13:54.860
And they're...

13:55.250 --> 13:57.660
I am Raphtalia, his attendant.

13:58.060 --> 14:00.600
Filo! My name is Filo!

14:01.570 --> 14:03.219
I'm Sadeena.

14:03.220 --> 14:04.659
I'm Atla.

14:04.660 --> 14:05.530
Fohl.

14:06.870 --> 14:08.629
It's a pleasure to meet you.

14:08.630 --> 14:13.249
I bought these two while they
were enslaved in Zeltoble.

14:13.250 --> 14:15.540
They're apparently not pureblooded Hakuko.

14:15.910 --> 14:20.760
They will not interfere in the power struggles
of this country, so you can rest assured.

14:21.240 --> 14:23.139
I see.

14:23.140 --> 14:25.700
Then, please go inside the castle.

14:27.870 --> 14:29.629
Shield Hero,

14:29.630 --> 14:33.469
I know you must be weary
from your long journey,

14:33.470 --> 14:35.850
but we humbly request an audience with you.

14:36.280 --> 14:37.619
An audience?

14:37.620 --> 14:39.480
Between who and whom?

14:53.590 --> 14:56.210
The attendants may not proceed
beyond this point.

15:18.840 --> 15:20.430
Shield Hero,

15:20.880 --> 15:23.859
until your return today,

15:23.860 --> 15:28.320
the races gathered here have governed
Siltvelt in your absence.

15:29.350 --> 15:32.160
I am Solea of the Genmu race.

15:33.030 --> 15:38.170
And I am Tsuaron, representative
of the Aotatsu race, Shield Hero.

15:40.630 --> 15:45.050
Ah... well, thanks...
for your efforts.

15:45.540 --> 15:47.010
Your words are too kind.

15:47.670 --> 15:50.219
So this is what you mean by an "audience"?

15:50.220 --> 15:54.429
Yes. We are all deeply honored.

15:54.430 --> 15:58.649
Then I'll get straight to the point.

15:58.650 --> 15:59.650
Yes.

16:02.090 --> 16:06.610
I have no intention of ruling over Siltvelt
or anything like that.

16:07.060 --> 16:10.020
Accomplishing an objective of mine
required me to stop by.

16:10.680 --> 16:15.340
I promise not to do anything that would cause
problems for those in charge of Siltvelt.

16:16.090 --> 16:20.019
I just want you to arrange
a trading ship to Q'ten Lo for us.

16:20.020 --> 16:22.340
We plan to leave Siltvelt
as soon as possible.

16:23.290 --> 16:24.540
I see.

16:24.970 --> 16:28.339
There seems to have been
a misunderstanding, Shield Hero.

16:28.340 --> 16:29.480
What?

16:29.860 --> 16:36.249
Please take some time first to rest from your
long journey and attend tonight's banquet.

16:36.250 --> 16:39.809
After that, we would be grateful
to hear your thoughts.

16:39.810 --> 16:42.029
But we're in a hurry...

16:42.030 --> 16:46.190
I'm sure there are people among you who'd
prefer I didn't stick around too long, right?

16:46.490 --> 16:49.319
True. And I can't deny that.

16:49.320 --> 16:53.190
But even so, it's necessary for us
to purge such corruption.

16:54.130 --> 16:57.870
Anyone who finds Master Naofumi's presence
inconvenient is a traitor to the country!

16:58.310 --> 17:01.320
They must be dealt with immediately!

17:02.940 --> 17:08.179
Our duty is to serve the Shield Hero
with unwavering loyalty.

17:08.180 --> 17:10.380
Please, do not forget that.

17:11.050 --> 17:12.479
How wonderful.

17:12.480 --> 17:14.889
A demonstration of devotion to Master Naofumi!

17:14.890 --> 17:19.589
Then shouldn't you be working to grant
my request as quickly as possible?

17:19.590 --> 17:22.309
Of course, we will prepare the ship.

17:22.310 --> 17:27.899
However, now that our king we revere
as our god has finally returned,

17:27.900 --> 17:30.570
you want to leave us so soon?

17:31.020 --> 17:34.030
Treating this country as nothing
more than a stopover?

17:34.430 --> 17:37.239
Surely, you've seen how joyfully
the people welcomed you.

17:37.240 --> 17:41.429
If you do such a thing,
they will feel abandoned by you,

17:41.430 --> 17:45.630
and Siltvelt will be plunged into sorrow.

17:46.110 --> 17:47.839
But we don't have the time...

17:47.840 --> 17:52.970
Worse still, your departure could incite riots
or even spark a military coup.

17:54.280 --> 17:58.289
That is how much you mean to this country.

17:58.290 --> 18:01.579
Please act as the Shield Hero that our people

18:01.580 --> 18:04.140
have long awaited and yearned for.

18:12.130 --> 18:13.639
Okay, fine.

18:13.640 --> 18:16.530
I'll at least attend the banquet.

18:17.710 --> 18:18.849
Thank you!

18:18.850 --> 18:23.909
We've prepared guest rooms for you
and your companions.

18:23.910 --> 18:27.250
Please rest there until the banquet begins.

18:27.610 --> 18:29.560
Separate rooms are going to be a problem.

18:30.180 --> 18:33.199
I doubt anyone could do much
to me at this point,

18:33.200 --> 18:35.750
but I'd prefer not to be alone just in case.

18:36.430 --> 18:41.330
I'm afraid we cannot
treat others as your equal.

18:41.890 --> 18:45.150
Doing so would be an affront to our religion.

18:45.570 --> 18:46.460
Umm...

18:48.040 --> 18:52.779
Would it be possible to have a room
prepared next to Master Naofumi's?

18:52.780 --> 18:55.109
The Hakuko race are getting
ahead of themselves again!

18:55.110 --> 18:56.950
How shameless.

19:02.780 --> 19:06.410
Understood.
We'll prepare it immediately.

19:07.560 --> 19:09.619
There's still time before tonight.

19:09.620 --> 19:13.879
Rather than staying cooped up in the room,
I'd like to go out and see the city.

19:13.880 --> 19:17.590
A royal procession for the Shield Hero!
How splendid!

19:18.050 --> 19:19.499
Well, then...

19:19.500 --> 19:20.810
However...

19:21.450 --> 19:25.269
If the king is going to tour the city,
it will require a fair amount of preparation.

19:25.270 --> 19:26.229
What?

19:26.230 --> 19:30.899
And if you were to suddenly appear,
the citizens would be shocked

19:30.900 --> 19:34.320
and regret not being able to
give you a proper welcome.

19:34.900 --> 19:40.939
Such a major event must be carefully prepared
and publicly announced beforehand.

19:40.940 --> 19:43.739
Fine. I won't go outside.

19:43.740 --> 19:46.369
Then can I at least walk around the castle?

19:46.370 --> 19:47.849
Of course!

19:47.850 --> 19:51.380
After all, this is your castle.

19:51.960 --> 19:56.599
That being said,
we can't go anywhere right now.

19:56.600 --> 19:59.910
Everything's under renovation,
and there's no freedom at all.

20:01.080 --> 20:05.250
This is troublesome. How many days
are they planning to hold us up?

20:06.830 --> 20:10.980
At this rate, it might not just be days
but could be months.

20:11.550 --> 20:13.940
Then we won't make it in time
for the Phoenix battle!

20:15.170 --> 20:16.329
Yeah, right.

20:16.330 --> 20:20.479
Their respect and loyalty to
Master Naofumi are admirable,

20:20.480 --> 20:22.950
but they really lack flexibility.

20:23.950 --> 20:27.289
So this is what the Three Heroes who were
worshiped like gods in Melromarc

20:27.290 --> 20:29.189
were dealing with too...

20:29.190 --> 20:34.920
Though I feel like they were even freer
than Master Naofumi is now.

20:35.220 --> 20:37.529
Having them prepare a ship

20:37.530 --> 20:42.390
while you skip out on fulfilling your duties
as the Shield Hero and just leave

20:42.870 --> 20:45.849
sounds pretty free too,
don't you think, Naofumi?

20:45.850 --> 20:48.189
You really hit where it hurts...

20:48.190 --> 20:50.349
Yeah, I admit I didn't phrase that very well.

20:50.350 --> 20:57.149
Ms. Sadeena, Master Naofumi is doing
all this for Raphtalia's sake.

20:57.150 --> 20:59.759
Of course I know that!

20:59.760 --> 21:03.279
I'm sorry for dragging you all into this.

21:03.280 --> 21:07.229
So, Master Naofumi, you should also
do various things for my sake too.

21:07.230 --> 21:08.809
How did you get to that conclusion?!

21:08.810 --> 21:11.480
Well, well, if it isn't the Shield Hero!

21:12.900 --> 21:14.200
Who are you?

21:15.090 --> 21:19.509
I am the representative of the Raio race.

21:19.510 --> 21:21.550
My name is Jaralis.

21:21.980 --> 21:24.010
A lion beastman, huh...

21:24.370 --> 21:29.829
I deeply apologize for greeting you
in such an informal setting.

21:29.830 --> 21:30.979
It's fine.

21:30.980 --> 21:33.639
By the way, Shield Hero...

21:33.640 --> 21:38.069
We're aware of your circumstances.

21:38.070 --> 21:40.589
If you seek a ship to Q'ten Lo,

21:40.590 --> 21:45.019
I could personally arrange one
for you right away.

21:45.020 --> 21:48.080
You weren't present during
the earlier audience.

21:49.130 --> 21:51.329
It doesn't seem like you
hold much power.

21:51.330 --> 21:53.000
But can you really do that?

21:54.270 --> 22:01.140
I look forward to seeing you again
at tonight's banquet.

22:12.810 --> 22:15.020
So high!

22:18.470 --> 22:21.780
Fohl, do you know anything
about that Jaralis guy?

22:22.510 --> 22:24.339
No, I've never heard of him.

22:24.340 --> 22:26.780
I've never seen that Werner guy before either.

22:27.190 --> 22:29.409
You're useless as always, big brother.

22:29.410 --> 22:30.370
Atla!

22:31.000 --> 22:36.169
Both of them seemed fishy, but the way
Jaralis immediately offered to prepare a ship

22:36.170 --> 22:40.340
suggests he and Werner aren't
exactly on the same page.

22:40.890 --> 22:43.749
He doesn't have enough power
to be part of the audience,

22:43.750 --> 22:48.050
but he seems like a figure at the forefront
of expanding his influence.

22:48.630 --> 22:50.850
What are you going to do, Naofumi?

22:51.590 --> 22:53.869
If we go with what the bird says,

22:53.870 --> 22:57.689
there's no telling when we'll
be able to leave Siltvelt.

22:57.690 --> 23:01.070
But the lion's offer sounds too convenient...

23:01.440 --> 23:06.029
Choosing one will probably mean
turning the other into an enemy.

23:06.030 --> 23:08.990
Looks like we'll have to just watch
and wait for a few days.

23:10.970 --> 23:14.869
I don't like complicated talk! I'm hungry!

23:14.870 --> 23:16.320
Yeah.

23:27.190 --> 23:31.170
Our journey to Q'ten Lo is still a long one.

23:36.230 --> 23:40.940
#2 A WARM WELCOME
